        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "g. Failure to notify the company of their intention to return to work within five (5) working days after recall notice, or failure to report for work on the day agreed upon. Such employee who fails to return to work shall be removed from all recall lists, except for temporary recalls pursuant to Article II, Section 2e.",
